@startuml

title RL Supervisor - State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Initializing

state Initializing
Initializing : entry / Prepare selected run mode

state Running
Running : do / Interact with the environment and record run results

state Training
Training : entry / Prepare collected trajectory
Training : do / Perform training update
Training : exit / Record training metrics

state Stopping
Stopping : entry / Stop simulation

Initializing --> Running
Running --> Training : environment cycle completed [training mode and sufficient trajectory data collected]
Training --> Running : [training mode and further updates configured]
Training --> Stopping : [training mode and configured run update count reached]
Running --> Stopping : environment cycle completed [evaluation mode and configured episode limit reached]
Running --> Stopping : environment cycle completed [environment termination detected]
Stopping --> [*]

@enduml
